Upstream's bottom strip and the keyboard on the pill (omamobile-shell 0.2.40 to 0.2.42).

One 44 px strip below the apps replaces the floating pill and the hide button, so taps
at the bottom centre of an app stop being eaten and nothing floats over a terminal's
input line. A double tap on the pill shows or hides the keyboard. From omarchy-mobile
1154721, the files of plugins/omamobile.keyboard and omamobile.launcher only, as a
patch rather than a move to 0.2.45: 0.2.44's home changes bring a bl_power read every
2 s and nothing for this tablet (docs/image/OMARCHY-MOBILE-AUDIT.md §5).

